  "generated_text": "First, compute the dot product of the vectors:\n\\[\n\\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} = (2)(-1) + (-1)(1) + (1)(0) = -2 - 1 = -3.\n\\]\nNext, compute the magnitudes of the vectors:\n\\[\n\\left\\| \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\right\\| = \\sqrt{2^2 + (-1)^2 + 1^2} = \\sqrt{6},\n\\]\n\\[\n\\left\\| \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\right\\| = \\sqrt{(-1)^2 + 1^2 + 0^2} = \\sqrt{2}.\n\\]\nThen, compute the cosine of the angle between the vectors:\n\\[\n\\cos \\theta = \\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{-3}{6} = -\\frac{1}{2}.\n\\]\nThus, $\\theta = \\boxed{60^\\circ}$.",
  "grade": {
